      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2015 Elsevier Ltd and ISBI. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "This n=40 cohort study on superficial and partial thickness burns compares novel keratin-based products with the standard products used at our facility. The keratin products are found to facilitate healing with minimal scarring, be well tolerated with minimal pain and itch, be easy to use for the health professional and be cost effective for the health care provider. For these reasons they are being adopted into use at our facility."
      },
